          <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-bottom:20px">
            <div style="width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--c-cream);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:var(--f-serif);font-size:1.1rem;color:var(--c-gold);font-weight:600">K</div>
            <div>
              <div style="font-weight:600;font-size:0.95rem;color:var(--c-navy)">K.T 讒・/div>
              <div style="font-size:0.75rem;color:var(--c-gray)">蜃ｺ蠑ｵ謨ｴ菴・120蛻・/div>
            </div>
            <div style="margin-left:auto;color:var(--c-gold);font-size:0.9rem;letter-spacing:2px">笘・・笘・・笘・/div>
          </div>
          <p style="font-size:0.9rem;color:var(--c-gray-dark);line-height:1.9">螟懷共譏弱￠縺ｧ菴薙′繝舌く繝舌く縺ｮ迥ｶ諷九〒蜃ｺ蠑ｵ繧偵♀鬘倥＞縺励∪縺励◆縲よｷｱ螟懊↓繧る未繧上ｉ縺壻ｸ∝ｯｧ縺ｫ蟇ｾ蠢懊＠縺ｦ縺・◆縺縺阪∬・螳・↑縺ｮ縺ｧ縺昴・縺ｾ縺ｾ逵繧後ｋ縺ｮ縺梧怙鬮倥〒縺吶ょｼｷ縺輔ｂ螂ｽ縺ｿ縺ｫ繝斐ャ繧ｿ繝ｪ縺ｧ縺励◆縲・/p>
